        "original_id": "e1d4c44a-832d-557f-b106-f0bd222147c5",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Peter B. Gillis, Sal Buscema\n- Characters: Ghaur, Eternals, Celestials, Deviants\n- Comics: Eternals\n- Concepts: Earth's defense, war between Eternals and Deviants\n\nFacts:\n- Peter B. Gillis and Sal Buscema created Ghaur.\n- Ghaur first appeared in \"Eternals\".\n- The Celestials originally initiated the process that created the Eternals and the Deviants.\n- The Celestials intended the Eternals to serve as defenders of Earth.\n- The Celestials' design made war between the Eternals and the destructive Deviants inevitable.",
